  "We stumbled breathlessly towards the amusement park’s exit, only to find the iron gates closeed.",
  'Damn it! Why did they close so early today?',
  "Samuel roared, slamming his fist against the cold metal.",
  "(A chill ran down my spine. I remembered the rigid rules, the ones no one ever questioned.)",
  "|highlight>[(The blackout in the circus was around 10:30. It had only been a couple of minutes after the show ended. The park was supposed to close at 11:30. Someone had closed the gates an hour early.)]",
  "What the hell is happening? What even are those things?",
  "I whispered, my voice trembling.",
  "Samuel lost all hope in his eyes.",
  'So this is the anomaly you warned me about? Thats some crazy horror. No wonder there were rumors about people keep coming back, its a one way park afterall.',
  "Nah, Theres no way.",
  "I shot back, scanning the chaos around us.",
  "(If this ever hit the internet, no one would dare set foot here again.)",
  "The scene was a nightmare. Tourists scattered in every direction, their screams attracted the bloodthirsty creatures, prowling the grounds, hunting with relentless fury.",
  "Everyone had broken the rules. They had nothing that they could do except from accepting the fate of the monsters killing them.",
  "What do we do?",
  "Samuel’s voice cracked,he had finally lost it. Fear finally broke through his bravado shattering his last bit of hope.",
  "I swallowed hard, forcing calm into my words.",
  "It’s too dangerous here. Let’s move to a nearby zone. Staying out in the open is same as suicide."
))
