:: The Drifter’s Sacrifice [en] {"position":"3025,525","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "But when I finally reached him, something was horribly wrong. Samuel’s eyes were hollow, devoid of any spark of life.",
  "His face was as pale as parchment, and his clothes hung in bloody rags. He moved with a sickening rigidity, like a puppet jerked by invisible strings.",
  "He didn't respond to my voice; he didn't even blink. Instead, his lips were curled into a faint, grotesque smile—the exact same icy, unsettling grin worn by the monsters in the red uniforms." ,
  "Watch out! Don't go near him! He’s not Samuel anymore!",
  "Astor’s voice cut through the air, sharp and desperate. He lunged forward, grabbing my shoulder to pull me back.",
  "They’ve taken him! He’s one of them now!",
  "I snapped back to my senses and tried to retreat, but 'Samuel' was faster.",
  "His hand—cold as a corpse—clamped around my throat with staggering strength, as if he intended to crush my windpipe.",
  "At that heart-stopping moment, a familiar figure charged between us: it was the drifter from the corridor.",
  "He stood as a shield before me, his mind clearly fractured beyond repair.",
  "|imp>[My wife... they did this to her too...]",
  "he whimpered, before his voice broke into a defiant roar.",
  "|shake>[NOT AGAIN!]",
  "Mabel’s voice echoed, dripping with mockery.",
  "What a shame. Why are you two so afraid of me?",
  "After the drifter was brutally mauled, he gasped out his final words with his dying breath:",
  "|imp>[My wife... parking lot... circus back door... keys... office...]"
))

(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "Astor", "", "Astor", "", "", "", "", "???", "", "???", "", "Mabel", "", "???"))
(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's ($step))
(set: $nextPassage to "none")

(display: "DialogBox")
(display: "Styles")
}

