:: The room with faint traces of blood at the threshold [en] {"position":"1975,875","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $dialogs to (a: 
  "(The bloodstains at the doorway brought me an unease I couldn't shake.) I stood behind Samuel as he pushed the door open.",
  "As he opened the door, I see two human, two human who were both drenched in blood. They flinched at the sight of us, just as startled as we were.",
  "We greeted them carefully as if wewere scared if they were one of those monsters or impostors of the park." ,
  "Hello. My name's Astor.",
  "And I am Clara.",
  "The moment we stepped inside,(the door shut behind us with a loud bang). It is one of the maze's cruel tricks—once one has chosen his own paths, there will be no turning back for him. |highlight>[Every step is a gamble.]",
  "Do you two know what's happening?",
  "We have no idea.",
  "We saw those… (text-style:'bold')['things']… and ran straight here. Everything was fine just a few days ago and now there are monsters and crazy shit i never thought that actually exist.",
  "Have you been here before?",
  "A friend of mine is a VIP member of this group. He used to bring me and a group of friends here all the time. It was just few days ago, Clara and I brought our parents here. They said they were coming too... But then we couldnt even contact them, they just vanished like that.",
  "(My mind got flooded with so many questions—so many question marks in my mind that I barely knew where to start. Before I could kept on asking, Samuel cut in.)",
  "Look! What the hell is that (text-style:'bold')[big red arrow]?",
  "That's strange… we have never seen that before.",
  "Let's follow it.",
  "The exit from here leads straight to the park gate. If we go this way… maybe we can actually get out of here."
))

(set: $names to (a: "", "", "", "Astor", "Clara", "", "Me", "Clara", "Astor", "Me", "Astor", "", "Samuel", "Astor", "Samuel", "Clara"))
(set: $step to 1)
(set: $msgName to $names's ($step))
(set: $nextPassage to "Mark’s Warning in the Maze")

(display: "DialogBox")
